        "title": "Extremophiles and the Limits of Life",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Extremophiles redefine the habitable parameter space. Every time we find life in a new extreme, we expand the range of environments elsewhere that might support it. The key insight for astrobiology: the limits of life are much broader than intuition suggests."
